WEBVTT

00:01.320 --> 00:05.430
At present, no noteworthy 
disturbances have been reported.

00:06.090 --> 00:08.640
Peace is returning to the realm.

00:09.340 --> 00:12.100
I'm glad that your wounds 
have healed, as well.

00:12.780 --> 00:14.570
I demanded much of you.

00:15.030 --> 00:17.030
Anything for Your Majesty.

00:17.810 --> 00:18.820
I see.

00:20.750 --> 00:24.130
Still, the palace seems 
somewhat less than peaceful.

00:24.590 --> 00:28.330
All in the name of preparation for 
the ceremony in two days' time.

00:28.900 --> 00:34.870
Fenrir's dissidents have been brought 
to heel, and Your Majesty is well.

00:34.870 --> 00:38.350
We shall celebrate with a triumphal 
procession through the city.

00:38.610 --> 00:40.310
I need no pomp.

00:40.310 --> 00:46.280
But in this triumph, as at 
the Grand Consecration,

00:46.280 --> 00:50.550
it may be wise to keep 
Lady Sariphi out of sight.

00:51.370 --> 00:56.090
Our king risked his life to 
rescue his queen from a foe.

00:56.090 --> 00:59.690
Were you both beasts, 
no tale could be more moving.

01:00.000 --> 01:00.920
However,

01:01.590 --> 01:07.910
a reminder that you acted for a 
human girl would be the lone blot

01:07.910 --> 01:10.340
to dampen this victorious mood.

01:16.640 --> 01:18.890
Far be it from me to say more.

01:19.440 --> 01:22.170
I shall defer to Your Majesty's judgment.

02:55.020 --> 03:00.030
A Bridge Between Beasts and Humans

03:00.550 --> 03:01.490
Wow!

03:01.770 --> 03:04.050
These look even more delicious than usual!

03:04.050 --> 03:06.800
I baked them to celebrate 
His Majesty's recovery.

03:06.800 --> 03:08.800
Would you care for one, Sir Lante?

03:08.800 --> 03:12.470
Sorry, but I swore off sweet 
stuff for my training.

03:12.470 --> 03:14.780
Oh, my. Did you really?

03:15.120 --> 03:16.810
Why, Lady Sariphi.

03:17.130 --> 03:19.040
What's become of your ring?

03:19.040 --> 03:21.550
Oh, it broke.

03:21.550 --> 03:25.260
Goodness! Wasn't that 
a gift from His Majesty?

03:25.260 --> 03:27.270
You knew about that, Amit?

03:27.270 --> 03:33.510
You always wore it, and the stone 
matched the hue of His Majesty's eyes.

03:33.510 --> 03:36.480
Anyone would know at a glance.

03:37.350 --> 03:40.330
Who cares if you lost that little pebble?

03:40.330 --> 03:44.460
You'll have your pick of way fancier 
stuff once you're queen for real.

03:44.890 --> 03:46.500
And I'll have one after all.

03:48.560 --> 03:52.360
If it comes as a gift from one's beloved,

03:52.360 --> 03:56.880
even a pebble from the roadside 
will outshine any gem.

03:57.210 --> 03:58.580
Amit...

03:58.980 --> 04:01.790
Why not ask him for something really lavish?

04:01.790 --> 04:05.050
I don't know about lavish, Lady Sariphi,

04:05.050 --> 04:09.280
but perhaps you <i>should</i> ask His Majesty 
for something to replace it.

04:11.880 --> 04:12.860
Your ring?

04:13.140 --> 04:15.470
Oh, so it broke.

04:15.910 --> 04:19.860
But I gave you that to alleviate the miasma,

04:20.250 --> 04:23.820
and you've now built up a tolerance to it.

04:24.090 --> 04:25.830
You should no longer need it.

04:26.440 --> 04:27.780
Tell me, sire,

04:28.230 --> 04:32.780
do you remember what I told you 
when you gave that ring to me?

04:36.930 --> 04:38.410
Sorry! It's nothing!

04:39.110 --> 04:42.390
<i>I guess it </i>was<i> a long time ago.</i>

04:42.650 --> 04:44.140
<i>I shouldn't be surprised.</i>

04:44.140 --> 04:45.070
Sariphi.

04:46.050 --> 04:48.550
Come. I have something to show you.

04:51.790 --> 04:53.730
Where are we going, sire?

04:53.730 --> 04:56.060
We've already flown a long way.

04:56.720 --> 04:57.780
We've arrived.

04:57.780 --> 04:58.730
Huh?

05:08.840 --> 05:09.900
A tree...

05:10.540 --> 05:15.940
It reminds me of the one the palace 
is built into, but this one is thriving.

05:16.690 --> 05:19.750
Wards normally hide this 
great tree from sight.

05:20.520 --> 05:21.460
We'll land here.

05:22.950 --> 05:26.170
How strange. A spring of blue water.

05:26.670 --> 05:29.310
This water is untainted by any miasma.

05:29.830 --> 05:33.390
Such a clear spring is a wonder in Ozmargo.

05:33.920 --> 05:40.290
The ambrosia that I used to make 
your ring only bears fruit here.

05:41.010 --> 05:42.900
This blue water is said to be

05:42.900 --> 05:49.170
a remnant of a time when blue skies, 
not clouds of miasma, canopied this land.

05:50.070 --> 05:51.740
Ozmargo used to be like that?

05:52.100 --> 05:55.450
So legend has it. I don't know the truth.

05:55.800 --> 05:59.170
But due to that legend, this place 
is considered holy ground.

05:59.640 --> 06:05.580
Only mighty royalty and select priests 
may cross the wards that safeguard it.

06:05.580 --> 06:08.700
Should someone like me really be here, then?

06:09.170 --> 06:11.170
I always meant to show you

06:11.490 --> 06:15.890
this clear, beautiful blue—
the same color as your eyes.

06:16.730 --> 06:18.650
Th-Thank you.

06:18.930 --> 06:22.110
But your eyes are a lovely color, too, sire.

06:22.620 --> 06:25.050
They're warm, like fire.

06:26.040 --> 06:27.060
Sariphi,

06:27.760 --> 06:28.600
give me your hand.

06:29.490 --> 06:30.710
The other one.

06:31.530 --> 06:34.170
Is it not the third finger of the left hand

06:34.990 --> 06:38.270
on which a ring has a special significance?

06:41.140 --> 06:42.390
<i>Sire,</i>

06:43.060 --> 06:49.090
do you know what putting a ring on your 
left ring finger means in human lands?

06:49.370 --> 06:50.440
Well, you see,

06:51.470 --> 06:55.590
it's a token of a promise 
to stay together forever.

06:56.760 --> 06:58.350
You remembered?

07:00.020 --> 07:01.510
I'm so glad.

07:01.510 --> 07:02.480
Thank you.

07:02.810 --> 07:07.100
That's still but an improvised 
adornment. Step back a bit.

07:24.270 --> 07:29.120
I saw your last ring as a 
tool to keep you safe.

07:29.540 --> 07:30.720
But this

07:31.050 --> 07:33.680
is a genuine token of our vows.

07:34.980 --> 07:39.230
Proof that you and I will never part.

07:41.800 --> 07:43.110
<i>What should I do?</i>

07:43.570 --> 07:47.230
<i>Can I really afford to indulge 
in these feelings?</i>

07:48.070 --> 07:52.020
<i>I can't go back to who I was 
before I knew them.</i>

07:53.800 --> 07:54.840
Sariphi.

07:55.770 --> 08:00.240
At tomorrow's ceremony, 
stand beside me wearing this ring,

08:00.820 --> 08:04.940
as my one and only lawful queen-to-be.

08:05.560 --> 08:08.690
<i>Me, stand with His Majesty?</i>

08:09.040 --> 08:10.220
The king!

08:10.220 --> 08:12.160
Long live the king!

08:12.160 --> 08:14.250
Long live Ozmargo!

08:20.400 --> 08:23.890
I won't appear in that ceremony.

08:23.890 --> 08:25.340
Sariphi...

08:25.650 --> 08:28.810
There will be a big fuss if I do.

08:28.810 --> 08:30.830
I'll silence it.

08:31.130 --> 08:33.430
I'll dispel all distressing chatter.

08:33.430 --> 08:36.150
I swear that I'll protect you!

08:36.150 --> 08:41.120
It's not "distressing chatter." 
It's the voices of this kingdom's people.

08:42.490 --> 08:44.490
I appreciate the thought.

08:44.490 --> 08:48.820
But I'll become a queen worthy of you, sire,

08:49.360 --> 08:50.830
so wait until I do.

08:50.830 --> 08:52.460
Sariphi...

08:52.460 --> 08:53.560
In exchange,

08:53.990 --> 08:57.960
once the ceremony is over, 
go back to being <i>my</i> king.

09:00.190 --> 09:02.430
Very well. I understand.

09:02.750 --> 09:04.190
The king!

09:04.190 --> 09:07.770
<i>Perhaps I was a bit too hasty.</i>

09:04.630 --> 09:05.950
Long live the king!

09:08.810 --> 09:12.530
<i>Sariphi, I have every faith in you.</i>

09:16.240 --> 09:17.610
Good grief.

09:17.930 --> 09:20.520
Do you need to bring <i>all</i> these 
to your room at once?

09:20.520 --> 09:22.100
We're helping carry!

09:21.440 --> 09:22.820
Carry!

09:22.820 --> 09:27.630
Sorry. When a book catches my eye, 
I can't rest unless I read it straight away.

09:27.630 --> 09:32.090
What's so fun about reading? I don't get it.

09:32.550 --> 09:35.100
Books are full of things I don't know.

09:38.570 --> 09:39.300
Oh?

09:39.300 --> 09:41.260
Dear me.

09:41.260 --> 09:44.530
I humbly beg your pardon, 
Acting Queen Consort.

09:44.530 --> 09:46.230
Have I injured you?

09:46.230 --> 09:48.620
Oh, no. I'm fine.

09:49.250 --> 09:50.290
Then, by your leave.

09:51.500 --> 09:52.510
Who's he?

09:52.510 --> 09:57.450
Justice Set. I've barely ever 
spoken with him, either.

09:57.450 --> 09:59.920
He doesn't leave much of an impression.

10:00.750 --> 10:01.670
Is that all of them?

10:02.340 --> 10:04.880
You'd better hurry back to your room, then.

10:05.650 --> 10:07.580
It looks like rain.

10:13.680 --> 10:15.550
Do you feel calmer now?

10:15.930 --> 10:18.010
Yes, I'm fi—

10:21.650 --> 10:26.630
I suppose I left that wound on your heart.

10:27.030 --> 10:28.030
What do you mean?

10:28.310 --> 10:30.780
You said it all began on a night like this,

10:30.780 --> 10:34.480
when you learned that you 
were to be a sacrifice.

10:35.850 --> 10:41.080
My royal predecessor decreed the 
sacrifices, and I continued them.

10:41.080 --> 10:42.330
But, sire, you—

10:42.330 --> 10:46.680
True, I never devoured a sacrificial maiden,

10:47.160 --> 10:51.710
but I can do nothing for the girls 
I spare after they escape.

10:52.340 --> 10:58.620
And once chosen as sacrifices, they can 
never return to their former lives.

10:59.120 --> 11:05.270
Even now, at your side, I am 
powerless to calm this storm.

11:06.600 --> 11:10.000
Hey, sire, would you tell me a story?

11:10.000 --> 11:10.830
A story?

11:10.830 --> 11:11.520
Yeah.

11:12.170 --> 11:13.430
Very well.

11:13.790 --> 11:16.400
Then I will tell you of my mother.

11:17.100 --> 11:17.980
You don't mind?

11:18.330 --> 11:24.870
It would be unfair of me to learn 
your past without sharing mine.

11:26.660 --> 11:30.340
When I was young, "mother" to me meant

11:30.340 --> 11:34.660
the portrait of the late queen, who I 
was told had died soon after my birth.

11:35.660 --> 11:37.410
But that queen

11:37.860 --> 11:39.950
was not my mother.

11:40.600 --> 11:44.090
So where did I come from?

11:44.600 --> 11:50.070
Do I truly have a mother? Does she 
still live somewhere in the world?

11:50.900 --> 11:53.420
Sometimes I still ponder, even now.

11:54.390 --> 11:59.280
Did my father, who loathed 
other species, love my mother?

11:59.640 --> 12:03.620
Did the mother whom I've never seen love me?

12:04.500 --> 12:10.610
Did anyone wish for my birth?

12:10.960 --> 12:12.100
Sire...

12:12.370 --> 12:18.640
Forgive me. I spoke of parity, but I may 
as well have told you nothing at all.

12:19.150 --> 12:19.750
No.

12:20.430 --> 12:22.300
Thank you for telling me.

12:23.590 --> 12:27.120
<i>His Majesty was born with the blood 
of two conflicting peoples.</i>

12:27.940 --> 12:31.350
<i>My own parents abandoned me.</i>

12:31.890 --> 12:36.560
Even if no one did want us to be born,

12:36.560 --> 12:38.380
what can we do about it?

12:38.380 --> 12:40.270
I mean, we're already here.

12:41.500 --> 12:46.490
Thanks to that, we can desire 
someone and be desired now,

12:47.060 --> 12:49.700
and that matters so, so much more.

12:50.250 --> 12:52.110
Yes, you're right.

12:52.690 --> 12:55.710
<i>The past counts for less than the present.</i>

12:56.180 --> 12:58.640
<i>And the future.</i>

12:59.290 --> 13:00.310
Sariphi.

13:00.970 --> 13:01.900
What is it?

13:02.290 --> 13:05.810
I've been toying with an 
idea for some time now.

13:07.110 --> 13:13.570
Several nights of revelation from now, 
Yoana will send another sacrifice.

13:14.090 --> 13:14.760
Yes.

13:15.340 --> 13:19.750
Trickery can only fool the court for so long.

13:20.360 --> 13:24.890
And those chosen as sacrifices 
will suffer regardless.

13:25.580 --> 13:29.130
The time has come to strike 
at the root of the problem.

13:29.830 --> 13:31.080
You mean...

13:31.750 --> 13:34.700
<i>He'll abolish the system of sacrifices?!</i>

13:35.680 --> 13:40.180
Sacrifice is the power balance between 
beasts and humans in microcosm.

13:40.180 --> 13:44.800
The older generations who experienced 
the war will oppose its abolition.

13:44.800 --> 13:48.680
But new generations have not 
learned to hate humans,

13:48.680 --> 13:50.900
and their numbers will surely grow.

13:51.370 --> 13:59.100
If they are to face humans earnestly, 
unswayed by prejudice and past discord,

13:59.440 --> 14:04.330
I must lay a foundation of normal 
relations between our realms now.

14:04.770 --> 14:07.390
That is my duty as king.

14:08.070 --> 14:09.400
<i>Sire...</i>

14:09.400 --> 14:15.380
But first, we must overcome an obstacle: 
the principle of mutual inviolability.

14:15.900 --> 14:18.210
What's that?

14:18.670 --> 14:24.160
Anyone who crosses the border for 
any reason, in either direction,

14:24.160 --> 14:26.680
does so at their own mortal peril.

14:26.960 --> 14:31.220
To reconcile with Yoana, 
we must send emissaries to them.

14:31.660 --> 14:35.290
But our envoys will have no one 
to guarantee their safety.

14:36.680 --> 14:40.200
So if the envoys were to die for some reason...

14:40.490 --> 14:43.570
Hatred of humans would only grow,

14:43.570 --> 14:46.660
and the road to reconciliation 
would grow much longer.

14:47.270 --> 14:50.880
<i>Just like the beast realm 
is dangerous for humans,</i>

14:50.880 --> 14:54.400
<i>the human realm is a 
dangerous place for beasts.</i>

14:55.430 --> 14:56.320
<i>Human?</i>

14:57.270 --> 14:58.420
Sire...

14:59.290 --> 15:02.220
Could I be your envoy?

15:04.390 --> 15:05.570
Since I'm...

15:09.590 --> 15:11.300
I am opposed!

15:11.570 --> 15:14.760
Abolishing the system of sacrifices 
at all is ill-advised.

15:14.760 --> 15:17.670
No one will ever accept such a thing!

15:17.670 --> 15:20.390
The change need not be immediate.

15:20.730 --> 15:26.690
I will propose creating a space 
for our realms to speak directly.

15:26.690 --> 15:28.440
<i>That</i> is the problem!

15:29.060 --> 15:31.550
Do you realize what it would mean

15:31.550 --> 15:34.250
for us to be seen reaching out to Yoana?!

15:34.680 --> 15:35.440
Naturally.

15:36.130 --> 15:38.850
For the sake of restoring 
diplomatic relations in the future,

15:38.850 --> 15:43.980
Ozmargo will henceforth negotiate 
with Yoana as an equal nation.

15:44.710 --> 15:48.190
B-But sire, how can Yoana be our equal?

15:48.190 --> 15:52.710
Vanquishing the rebels allowed you 
to display your royal dignity,

15:52.710 --> 15:55.430
but the people will never stand for this!

15:55.430 --> 15:59.890
"The people"? Don't you mean <i>you</i>, old-timers?

16:00.270 --> 16:05.640
Most people these days haven't seen 
enough of humans to really hate 'em.

16:05.640 --> 16:10.430
Don't act like you speak for the masses 
when you never listen to them.

16:10.430 --> 16:12.070
I-Insolence!

16:12.070 --> 16:13.880
Mind your tongue!

16:13.880 --> 16:15.860
We won't get anywhere with you guys.

16:16.520 --> 16:18.510
If Sariphi goes, then so will I.

16:18.930 --> 16:20.840
Isn't that what a guard captain's for?

16:21.430 --> 16:24.460
Lante, we should excuse ourselves.

16:25.970 --> 16:31.390
Ugh! Me going with you 
would solve all our problems.

16:31.670 --> 16:37.540
But if a beast like you got in a fight 
with humans, we'd have trouble.

16:38.160 --> 16:40.230
Can you swear you won't fight?

16:40.230 --> 16:41.220
Nope!

16:40.640 --> 16:41.600
<b>HONEST</b>

16:40.640 --> 16:41.600
<b>HONEST</b>

16:41.220 --> 16:42.180
See?

16:43.050 --> 16:47.140
<i>Of course, this is easier said than done.</i>

16:47.620 --> 16:50.120
Sire. Did you talk things out?

16:50.120 --> 16:55.080
No. Anubis wishes to speak with you privately.

16:55.350 --> 16:57.040
He does?

17:05.990 --> 17:10.630
Unbelievable. Can't young women 
these days so much as clean properly?

17:11.260 --> 17:13.090
Who is <i>that</i> an impression of?!

17:15.040 --> 17:19.140
Girl, do you honestly believe 
that beasts and humans can come

17:19.140 --> 17:21.340
to an understanding with each other?

17:21.620 --> 17:25.320
Well, I know that it won't be easy, but—

17:25.320 --> 17:27.360
Spare me the preamble.

17:27.730 --> 17:29.310
Answer yes or no.

17:30.530 --> 17:32.770
I think... we can.

17:33.260 --> 17:36.240
And by volunteering as an envoy,

17:36.240 --> 17:39.870
do you believe you can become a bridge 
between beasts and humans?

17:39.870 --> 17:41.610
Be truthful, girl.

17:41.610 --> 17:45.930
Me, a bridge? Oh, Mr. Chancellor, 
you're exaggerating.

17:45.930 --> 17:47.880
That was exactly my point!

17:47.880 --> 17:51.600
How vexing! I knew that talking 
to humans was a waste of time!

17:51.600 --> 17:55.080
You mean talking to me, 
not "to humans," don't you?

17:57.020 --> 18:02.180
This isn't about humans and beasts. 
You just don't like me.

18:03.340 --> 18:07.940
If someone as hard-headed as you 
can see a person before their species,

18:07.940 --> 18:09.720
then other people can do it, too.

18:09.650 --> 18:10.150
<b>FREEZE</b>

18:10.410 --> 18:13.390
I can't help it if they don't like what they see.

18:13.390 --> 18:18.280
But perfect strangers hating each other 
through misconceptions and hearsay?

18:19.070 --> 18:21.240
That terrifies me.

18:21.940 --> 18:27.030
So if approaching Yoana can 
change the future even slightly,

18:27.030 --> 18:30.280
then I'll do everything that I can right now.

18:31.310 --> 18:36.460
If there's something only I can do 
for the future His Majesty wants...

18:36.990 --> 18:40.600
If it will help the king who made 
me the person I am now...

18:41.850 --> 18:43.150
Very well.

18:43.630 --> 18:50.020
I will approve a diplomatic mission to Yoana 
and the appointment of you as our emissary.

18:50.490 --> 18:53.980
I shall inform the senate forthwith.

18:53.980 --> 18:55.840
Thank you, Mr. Chancellor!

18:55.840 --> 18:57.690
I guess you <i>can</i> be nice every now and then!

18:58.140 --> 19:00.100
I'll tell His Majesty, okay?

19:01.420 --> 19:03.840
<i>For His Majesty, is it?</i>

19:04.550 --> 19:07.120
<i>That girl never fails to irritate.</i>

19:08.180 --> 19:10.590
I see. So Anubis agreed.

19:11.270 --> 19:12.460
Very well.

19:12.690 --> 19:15.580
My message to Yoana is in your hands.

19:16.360 --> 19:17.420
Sire!

19:17.760 --> 19:21.670
But Lanteveldt and several 
guards will accompany you.

19:21.670 --> 19:24.920
Huh? But doesn't that defeat 
the point of sending me?

19:25.340 --> 19:27.560
I refuse to compromise on your safety.

19:28.010 --> 19:29.520
Please, sire.

19:29.520 --> 19:32.320
I know I'm not the most dependable, so—

19:32.640 --> 19:34.740
No! I—

19:34.740 --> 19:36.310
Hold it right there!

19:36.620 --> 19:41.350
Make way for the greatest 
holy beast, Bennu the phoenix!

19:41.350 --> 19:47.230
I ain't a beast <i>or</i> a human, so nothing 
can tie <i>me</i> down, numbskulls!

19:49.420 --> 19:50.450
Bennu!

19:50.820 --> 19:51.950
Hey.

19:51.950 --> 19:53.010
Of course!

19:53.010 --> 19:56.350
Beast and human laws 
don't apply to holy beasts!

19:56.350 --> 20:00.690
You got it, girlie. I'll just fly 
right over with you on my back.

20:01.010 --> 20:04.720
I can get to Yoana safely if I fly on Bennu.

20:04.720 --> 20:06.130
Please, sire!

20:08.760 --> 20:10.570
You win.

20:11.590 --> 20:16.490
<i>I knew it. Not a single trace 
in all these documents.</i>

20:17.430 --> 20:20.700
<i>The pregnancies of queens and concubines.</i>

20:20.700 --> 20:25.480
<i>Where and when they gave birth, the 
weather at the time, the attending priest...</i>

20:25.480 --> 20:31.070
<i>All these details that should have been 
recorded are conspicuously missing.</i>

20:31.650 --> 20:34.640
<i>And for only one royal.</i>

20:34.950 --> 20:35.930
<i>Yes,</i>

20:36.640 --> 20:40.410
<i>only the records of our current king's birth!</i>

20:43.140 --> 20:47.190
Lady Sariphi, please, please take care!

20:47.190 --> 20:50.250
Turn back at the first sign of danger!

20:49.370 --> 20:50.790
Sari!

20:50.790 --> 20:51.680
Ri!

20:51.680 --> 20:56.350
I still don't like it. 
Guarding you is my job.

20:56.350 --> 20:58.740
Thank you all for seeing me off.

20:59.110 --> 21:01.450
The king's awfully cold, though.

21:01.450 --> 21:04.980
I can't believe he didn't come to 
say goodbye. Is he still sulking?

21:04.980 --> 21:06.780
Nothing like that.

21:06.780 --> 21:11.600
His Majesty said his goodbyes 
when I left the palace.

21:12.510 --> 21:17.170
I just have to deliver your letter and 
come back with the answer, right?

21:19.740 --> 21:21.470
Well, I'd better get going.

21:22.660 --> 21:23.750
Sariphi.

21:24.810 --> 21:30.600
Making you my emissary is probably 
the best choice available to me.

21:30.600 --> 21:36.430
The decision may even 
leave its mark on history.

21:37.410 --> 21:38.980
And yet, I...

21:42.360 --> 21:46.360
Sire, I owe you an apology.

21:46.760 --> 21:51.640
I said that I knew you were worried 
because I'm not dependable.

21:52.090 --> 21:53.340
But that wasn't it, was it?

21:53.690 --> 22:00.870
You were only worried 
because you care about me.

22:02.270 --> 22:03.460
So...

22:05.690 --> 22:07.990
I won't tell you not to worry.

22:07.990 --> 22:10.580
Instead, I'll only ask you to wait.

22:12.420 --> 22:18.130
If you'll wait for me—if I can 
have a place to come home to—

22:18.660 --> 22:21.230
I'll be able to draw so much 
courage just from that.

22:22.360 --> 22:23.190
Yes.

22:25.510 --> 22:28.280
I'll be waiting for your return.

22:28.280 --> 22:29.020
So...

22:29.460 --> 22:32.290
Let me worry myself to death.

22:33.100 --> 22:33.780
Okay.

22:35.230 --> 22:38.020
<i>I'll be back, sire.</i>

22:42.160 --> 22:46.930
The king's birth holds some vital secret.

22:47.300 --> 22:51.900
Likely one whose exposure 
could upend everything.

22:51.900 --> 22:54.180
Please take care!

22:54.180 --> 22:55.620
Sari!

22:55.620 --> 22:57.230
You'd better make this quick!

22:57.630 --> 22:59.700
See you later, everyone!

23:01.910 --> 23:07.860
So, if I can uncover it, 
then I can finally achieve

23:08.160 --> 23:10.690
my long-cherished ambition!

23:15.610 --> 23:24.060
<i>As a human—and a sacrifice—
I will be the beasts' emissary to Yoana.</i>

23:25.780 --> 23:29.060
To end the sacrifices and normalize relations,

23:29.370 --> 23:31.420
with His Majesty's great resolve in my heart,

23:31.420 --> 23:34.420
I set out for my homeland, Yoana,

23:34.420 --> 23:36.080
as the beasts' emi—

23:36.080 --> 23:39.680
That's why I said to hang on tight, dimwit!

23:37.020 --> 23:40.010
Next Episode

23:37.020 --> 23:40.010
A Royal Letter and a Taboo Witch
